  "limitations": [
    "Stable ordering is scoped to one Run through run_sequence. global_sequence is an internal row identity, not a lossless cross-transaction commit cursor; API-07 must add a transactionally ordered global cursor or explicit fixed-snapshot protocol before exposing a global feed.",
    "AuditedPlanPersistenceService fails closed for write-bearing plans until RUN-08 and ORCH-08 can persist the complete authorization-set and approval-request epoch atomically with the Run plan and steps.",
    "RUN-06 retains complete external-action, delivery-attempt, connector-receipt, output, artifact, and safe-error timeline integration; current action and receipt audit shapes are foundational contracts rather than an end-to-end ORCH-09 claim.",
    "Execution reconstructs the persisted graph and recomputes the exact RUN-02 structural plan hash, but the trusted database remains a residual boundary for the ORCH-04 routing hash because its trigger and slot-policy input projection is not persisted here.",
    "AuditContext factories seal and pseudonymize typed provenance but do not authenticate a caller; API and worker composition must derive contexts from authenticated server-owned principals rather than request-body or actor-header values.",
    "SAFE-07 retains retention-time pseudonymization and deletion policy, DEL-04 retains migration ownership, ORCH-06 retains worker budgets and cancellation, and API-07 retains the operator timeline API and filters."
